## Code quality

- Standards: `CODING_STANDARDS.md` (overrides the clean-code skill where they differ).
- Before calling a change done, run `<check command>` and fix what it reports.
- Before committing, run `/finish` (interrogate, deslop, gates, fresh-context review, findings applied). Existing code is cleaned with `/deslop <path>`, or `/deslop repo` for the whole codebase.
